{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》隆重舉行，紅地氈環節星光熠熠。一眾當家花旦悉心打扮爭妍鬥麗，其中陳煒、陳自瑤、 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》隆重舉行，紅地氈環節星光熠熠。一眾當家花旦悉心打扮爭妍鬥麗，其中陳煒、陳自瑤、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳敏之及莊思明均以各具特色的華麗晚裝亮相，成為全場鎂光燈焦點。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>陳煒黑皮晚裝配毛絨披肩 型格與貴氣兼備</strong></b></h2>\n<p>向來散發高貴熟女韻味的陳煒，以一身黑色皮革細肩帶深V晚裝型格登場，貼身剪裁將曼妙身段表露無遺。她雙臂隨性披上黑色毛絨披肩，配襯貼服低髮髻及小巧黑色耳釘，在型格之中增添冬日奢華氣場，狀態大勇。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6223_18729143436afed530e1503-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6223_18729143436afed530e1503-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6221_4199921296afed53396be8-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6221_4199921296afed53396be8-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<h2><b><strong>陳自瑤蝴蝶結馬甲裙甜美搶鏡 與蕭正楠結伴登場</strong></b></h2>\n<p>同樣選擇黑色戰衣的陳自瑤，與身穿焦糖色西裝配鮮黃色高領內搭的蕭正楠結伴行紅地氈。陳自瑤身穿黑色平口馬甲大擺晚裝，胸前綴以特大立體蝴蝶結，下方更暗藏微鏤空小性感設計。她梳起清爽高丸子頭並配搭銀色長款吊墜耳環，向鏡頭揮手甜笑時少女感十足，甜美又不失女人味。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6554_16450788706afed52eedf5e-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6554_16450788706afed52eedf5e-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6645_20732461966afed52ca9a10-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-6645_20732461966afed52ca9a10-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<h2><b><strong>姚子羚透視黑裙顯知性 傅嘉莉皇家紫蓬裙明豔照人</strong></b></h2>\n<p>另一組焦點落在袁偉豪與兩位花旦姚子羚、傅嘉莉身上。姚子羚身穿全黑高領長袖貼身晚裝，胸前採用薄紗透視拼布，右肩配以立體緞面大蝴蝶結，加上斜分盤髮與水滴形吊墜耳環，盡顯知性優雅；身旁的傅嘉莉則以亮紫色緞面平口抹胸蓬裙搶鏡，修腰馬甲設計襯托出白皙膚色，配搭柔順直長髮及閃耀鑽飾，散發高貴公主氣質。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-5310_2061457786afed535bf5f1-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-5310_2061457786afed535bf5f1-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<h2><b><strong>陳敏之、莊思明銀色系戰衣閃爆全場</strong></b></h2>\n<p>擁有高挑身段的陳敏之與莊思明不約而同大玩閃亮銀色系造型。陳敏之挽著以黑白西裝配特大白領結亮相的曹永廉登場，身穿銀白色漸變珠片單肩魚尾拖尾長裙，腰側微鏤空與白色緞帶拼接設計盡顯名模級比例；莊思明則與全白西裝造型的楊明同行，一襲銀灰色金屬質感珠片垂墜晚裝高貴大方，為台慶紅地氈增添璀璨星光。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-4502_6350222366afed52a2b381-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-4502_6350222366afed52a2b381-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2><b><strong>龔嘉欣</strong></b></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7039_12161465596afed57bacd37-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7039_12161465596afed57bacd37-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<h2>張曦雯</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7545_7487858346afed61020432-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7545_7487858346afed61020432-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7705_8934818036afed65917a40-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7705_8934818036afed65917a40-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<h2>高海寧</h2>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7839_7366846556afed7a226dda-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-7839_7366846556afed7a226dda-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8038_13783611256afed7a53b037-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8038_13783611256afed7a53b037-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<h2>林夏薇</h2>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8148_9225517646afed798a2763-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 台慶 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-8148_9225517646afed798a2763-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e7%85%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳煒</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546047\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:37:10.132058+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1167,"images":12,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:38.337110+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:38.337110+00:00","content_hash":"6c1dde1641f9d18edd4c60adbab3da7660e7cc614aacfe4427b2920696593ef0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}